录请求模型字段、内部调用与 OutlineBuilder（ai_engine/gen/outline.py）三个公开方法签名/返回结构；确认 Python 侧无任何 outline 状态持久化（无 confirm 端点、无 outline Redis 键、无全局 outline 存储），outline_id/outline_version/outline_confirmed 仅作为透传字段出现在请求/任务结构体中，大纲草稿/确认/版本链明确由 Go 后端管理（main.py:673 docstring）。未修改任何文件。","findings":[{"claim":"ai_engine/main.py 定义了 POST /gen/outline 端点，逐字为：@app.post(\"/gen/outline\")\\nasync def generate_outline(req: GenOutlineRequest):\\n    \"\"\"[S3] 构建大纲：从 intent / markdown 生成节点树\"\"\"\\n    builder = OutlineBuilder()\\n    if req.markdown: result = await asyncio.to_thread(builder.build_from_markdown, req.markdown, req.course_name)\\n    else: result = await asyncio.to_thread(builder.build, req.intent, req.evidence_packet)\\n    return result；每次调用新建 OutlineBuilder()，无 response_model（直接返回 builder 的 dict），无状态纯函数","evidence":"read_file ai_engine/main.py offset=630 输出含 L657-668 端点体","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["ai_engine/main.py:657-668","ai_engine/main.py:660"]},{"claim":"GenOutlineRequest 模型字段为 intent: dict[str,Any]=Field(default_factory=dict)、evidence_packet: dict|None=None、markdown: str|None=None、course_name: str|None=None，四字段全部可选","evidence":"read_file ai_engine/main.py offset=588 输出 L599-604","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["ai_engine/main.py:599-604"]},{"claim":"ai_engine/main.py 定义了 POST /gen/outline/revise 端点，逐字为：@app.post(\"/gen/outline/revise\")\\nasync def revise_outline(req: GenOutlineReviseRequest):\\n    \"\"\"[S3] 仅计算大纲修订候选；版本和确认态仍由 Go 后端管理。\"\"\"\\n    return await asyncio.to_thread(OutlineBuilder().revise, req.nodes, req.message)；该 docstring 明示大纲的版本与确认状态不属于 Python 侧职责","evidence":"read_file ai_engine/main.py offset=630 输出 L671-677","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["ai_engine/main.py:671-677","ai_engine/main.py:673"]},{"claim":"GenOutlineReviseRequest 模型字段为 nodes: list[dict[str,Any]]（必填，无默认值）与 message: str（必填）","evidence":"read_file ai_engine/main.py offset=588 输出 L607-610","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["ai_engine/main.py:607-610"]},{"claim":"ai_engine/gen/outline.py 的 OutlineBuilder 有三个公开入口：build(intent: dict, evidence_packet: dict|None=None) -> {\"nodes\", \"used_fallback\"}；build_from_markdown(markdown: str, course_name: str|None=None) -> {\"nodes\", \"used_fallback\"}；revise(nodes: list[dict], message: str) -> {\"nodes\", \"change_summary\"}。build 做 S1 字段归一（title 取 intent.title or intent.topic，key_points 取 intent.key_points or intent.knowledge_points）并统一过 normalize_stage2_nodes","evidence":"read_section ai_engine/gen/outline.py L1-191 输出 outline.py:33-103","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["ai_engine/gen/outline.py:33-58","ai_engine/gen/outline.py:60-70","ai_engine/gen/outline.py:72-103"]},{"claim":"OutlineConfig 数据类仅含 model: str=''、temperature: float=0.2、max_nodes: int=20；OutlineBuilder.__init__(config=None, llm_client=None) 支持注入 LLMClient 供测试","evidence":"read_section ai_engine/gen/outline.py L1-191 输出 outline.py:17-25","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["ai_engine/gen/outline.py:17-29"]},{"claim":"LLM 节点树严格 schema（schema.py:26-58 build_stage2_node_tree_schema）允许每节点仅 node_id/title(≤60)/summary(≤60)/node_type(enum slide|section|quiz|interactive|cover|divider)/key_points(≤4)，additionalProperties=False；normalize_stage2_nodes（schema.py:159-226）输出的 canonical 节点字段全集为 node_id/title/summary/source_span/node_type/type/prerequisites/key_points/core_points/questions/interactive_questions/segments/layout_hint/font_size_hint/text_alignment/slide_background——此即 outline 节点对象在 Python 侧的有效字段全集，宽于 LLM schema","evidence":"read_section ai_engine/schema.py L26-230 输出 schema.py:26-58 与 159-226","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["ai_engine/schema.py:26-58","ai_engine/schema.py:159-226"]},{"claim":"Python 侧不存在 outline 状态持久化（已证无）：ai_engine 全目录 grep pattern 'outline_id|outline_|outline:' 与 '\"outline:\"|save_outline|outline_confirmed|outline_confirm' 均只命中请求/任务结构体字段与测试 fixture，未命中任何存储写入点；main.py 全部 33 个路由中 outline 相关仅 /gen/outline 与 /gen/outline/revise 两个，无 confirm/保存端点","evidence":"grep ai_engine/*.py outline_id|outline_|outline:；grep ai_engine/*.py 存储 pattern；grep main.py @app 路由清单","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["cmd: grep outline_id 命中 core/schema.py:441,608-611 与 main.py:702-703,976-977","cmd: grep @app 命中 ai_engine/main.py:657,671"]},{"claim":"outline_id/outline_version/outline_confirmed/outline_nodes 字段只存在于请求/任务结构体定义：core/schema.py:441-442（GenerationStatusResponse 等）、608-611（GenerationCreateRequest：outline_id/outline_version/outline_confirmed/outline_nodes），main.py:702-703（GenContentRequest）、976-977（GenFinalizeRequest）；/api/v1/gen/create 用 outline_confirmed/outline_version/outline_nodes 非空做 409 校验（main.py:1380-1386），由调用方（Go 后端）回传透传，Python 不读写","evidence":"grep ai_engine/*.py outline pattern + read_file main.py offset=630/offset=588","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["ai_engine/core/schema.py:608-611","ai_engine/main.py:1380-1386"]},{"claim":"main.py 唯一的进程内存/Redis 存储是内容生成任务 _content_tasks dict（main.py:721-722）与 _task_store = get_redis_task_store()（main.py:1344，L1343-1344 附近声明 _gen_tasks_lock），持久化键为 content:{content_id}（main.py:733,736 _persist_content_task_sync），与 outline 状态无关","evidence":"grep main.py task_store|_mem.|is_redis_available|redis 输出 L721-736 与 L1343-1344；read_file main.py offset=700 输出 L721-741","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["ai_engine/main.py:721-741","ai_engine/main.py:1344"]}],"artifacts":[{"kind":"note","title":"大纲端点两阶段 API 契约摘要","content":"POST /gen/outline 请求字段: intent(dict,可选)/evidence_packet(dict|None)/markdown(str|None)/course_name(str|None); 响应为裸 dict,形状 {'nodes': [...]}; markdown 分支走 build_from_markdown, 否则走 build。POST /gen/outline/revise 请求: nodes(list[dict] 必填)/message(str 必填); 响应 {'nodes', 'change_summary'}。两端点均无状态。"},{"kind":"note","title":"outline 状态存储归属(架构结论)","content":"Python 侧无大纲持久化: 无 confirm 端点、无 outline Redis 键、无全局 outline 存储(三组 pattern grep 已证无)。outline_id/outline_version/outline_confirmed/outline_nodes 仅是请求透传字段, 由 Go 后端回传。main.py:673 docstring 明示『版本和确认态仍由 Go 后端管理』。这解释了 worker-knowledge 中 Go 侧缺 service.NewOutlineService/handler.NewOutlineHandler 的根因: 大纲草稿/确认/版本链必须由 Go 后端补齐, Python 端无从补。"},{"kind":"note","title":"outline 节点字段全集","content":"LLM schema 最小约束(每节点): node_id/title/summary/node_type/key_points(≤4), node_type 枚举 slide|section|quiz|interactive|cover|divider, additionalProperties=False。normalize_stage2_nodes 输出 canonical 全集: node_id/title/summary/source_span/node_type/type/prerequisites/key_points/core_points/questions/interactive_questions/segments/layout_hint/font_size_hint/text_alignment/slide_background。兜底大纲 _fallback_outline 额外产出 source_span/prerequisites(不在 schema 内)。"},{"kind":"question","title":"待核验: 文件实际读取方式受限","content":"本会话 read_file/read_section 返回的是『选定证据/重读提示』而非完整文件全文(工具说明为 focused-read 语义), 但逐字摘录内容与 grep 行号锚点互相印证, 结论一致。若需绝对完整文件证据, 建议后续用行号区段逐段补读。另: 全部路径为 Windows 盘符形式(D:\\Desktop\\2026FWW-provin\\...), 与仓库根的相对路径无法在只读工具内归一, 属环境表述差异, 不影响结论。"}],"examinedFiles":["ai_engine/main.py","ai_engine/gen/outline.py","ai_engine/schema.py","ai_engine/core/schema.py","ai_engine/gen/tests/test_all.py","ai_engine/gen/tests/test_llm_unified.py","ai_engine/generator.py","ai_engine/tests/test_confirmed_outline_flow.py"],"risks":["本会话 read_file/read_section 返回 focused-read 选定证据而非完整文件全文, outline.py 全文(191 行)与 main.py 关键区段靠 read_section L1-191 / offset 段读取与 grep 行号锚点交叉印证, 未逐行扫全文件; 结论基于已见证据, 未见部分不设论断","schema.py:159-226 normalize 输出字段全集按 read_section 展示内容推断为完整返回结构, 但函数可能在此区间后还有返回前处理未展示(风险低, 因 L226 处字段拼装已闭合于 result.append)","所有路径证据为 Windows 绝对路径形式(D:\\Desktop\\2026FWW-provin\\), 与仓库相对路径无法在工具内统一, 引用时需自行归一"],"nextActions":["在 Go 后端 backend/internal/service 与 handler 补齐 OutlineService/OutlineHandler, 实现 outline 草稿/确认/版本链持久化, 对应 Python 侧 /gen/outline 与 /gen/outline/revise 两无状态端点","交叉核对 worker-knowledge 中 backend/internal/service/ai_engine_cl